WEBVTT

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:24.730
upon the cliff where hilltop stood can still see its hanging roofs against the cypress trees

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:33.540
But Hilltop is no more.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:40.200
There is only a scar of jutting rock where once its windows glittered in the California sun.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:45.980
My Aunt Amelia's house still stands next door.

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:49.560
I was a welcome guest within its walls.

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.470
